  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.air_current_interact_with_block.header": "物理结构上产生的批量加工气流",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.air_current_interact_with_block.text_1": "物理结构上产生的批量加工气流能够影响方块",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.air_current_interact_with_block.text_2": "“批量熔炼气流散播火焰”行为在默认配置中关闭，以避免新玩家的私人财产被意外焚毁。",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_coloring.header": "批量染色",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_coloring.text_1": "当气流吹过液态染料后，便可用于染色物品",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_coloring.text_2": "与批量熔炼和批量烟熏相同，批量染色自动兼容符合条件的需要染料的合成配方",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_coloring.text_3": "染色气流也能影响实体，改变其颜色",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_coloring.text_4": "装备在身上的盔甲也会被染色",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_enchanting.header": "批量附神",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_enchanting.text_1": "当气流吹过金黄境云后，便可用于批量附神",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_enchanting.text_2": "批量附神可以用风扇加工处理天境神能炉配方",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_enchanting.text_3": "部分配方会修复装备，因此输入和输出可能是同一种物品",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_enchanting.text_4": "同一股气流也可以将恐鸟蛋作为物品加工来孵化",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_ending.header": "批量终结",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_ending.text_1": "当气流吹过龙首或龙息后，便可用于终末转化物品",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_freezing.header": "批量冷冻",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_freezing.text_1": "当气流吹过细雪后，便可用于冷冻物品",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_sanding.header": "批量喷砂",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_sanding.text_1": "当气流吹过批量喷砂触媒（例：流沙）后，便可用于打磨物品",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.bulk_sanding.text_2": "与批量熔炼和批量烟熏相同，批量喷砂自动兼容砂纸打磨配方",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.dragon_breath_fluid.header": "龙息流体",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.dragon_breath_fluid.text_1": "龙息支持炼药锅行为",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.dragon_breath_fluid.text_2": "流动龙息遇到岩浆时会生成末地石",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.dye_fluids.header": "液态染料",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.dye_fluids.text_1": "将染料与水混合即可制成液态染料",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.dye_fluids.text_2": "加热混合液态染料可以重新得到染料物品",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.dye_fluids.text_3": "接触液态染料的物品和生物会被染色",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.dye_fluids.text_4": "液态染料遇到岩浆时会生成对应颜色的混凝土",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.fragile_fluid_tank.header": "易碎流体储罐",
  "create_dragons_plus.ponder.fragile_fluid_tank.text_1": "这些流体储罐很脆弱。它们会在遭到撞击时破碎",
